  "Haima": { job: "sage", level: 70, recast: "120s", range: "30y/0y", url: "https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/jobguide/sage/", text: "Erects a magicked barrier around self or target party member that absorbs damage equivalent to a heal of 300 potency. | Additional Effect: Grants 5 stacks of Haimatinon | Duration: 15s | When the barrier is completely absorbed, a stack of Haimatinon is consumed and a new barrier is applied. | When the effect duration expires, a healing effect is then applied. | Cure Potency: 150 per remaining stack of Haimatinon" },
